---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="ReefMetric privacy policy: calculator inputs, analytics, product images, and the email address used for the Reef Gear Cheat Sheet.">
  <section class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brand-2)">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: October 25, 2026.</em></p>
    <p>ReefMetric respects your privacy. This page explains what we collect and why.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to see visits and page use. This page loads Cloudflare's analytics script. If you request the Reef Gear Cheat Sheet, we also collect the email address you provide to send it. These are different activities: using a calculator does not sign you up for email.</p>
    <h2>Cookies &amp; consent</h2>
    <p>ReefMetric's current pages do not set their own cookies. The calculators do not use a tracking cookie to remember your inputs. When you visit a retailer through a product link, the retailer may use cookies or other tracking under its own policy. Read that policy and any choices offered on the retailer's site.</p>
    <h2>Calculator inputs</h2>
    <p>Tank size, plumbing dimensions, water readings, and fish selections are used by calculator code in your browser. The calculator code does not send those entries to a calculation service. The stocking planner saves its tank volume, filtration choice, and fish list in local browser storage when available. It restores that plan in the same browser; it is not synced to another device or account. Clearing site data removes it. Other calculator values reset on reload, including chemistry readings that should be re-tested before reuse. No account is needed.</p>
    <p>Your browser still makes normal requests to load pages, fonts, and scripts. Product thumbnails are served from this site, so loading them does not request an image from a retailer. Following a product or source link does make a request to that other site. Reading this site does not place an order with a retailer.</p>
    <h2>Requesting the cheat sheet</h2>
    <p>The email form sends the address you enter to our delivery service at api.aiappnation.com. The form is used to request one email with the sheet; it does not create a reef-tank account or save calculator inputs. A direct link to the web version is available before signup and after a successful request, so you can read it without sending an email.</p>
    <p>If you do not want to provide an address, you can use the tools and read the public reviews and guides without filling in the form. We do not sell the email address you provide. Use the contact address below for questions about a request or the information described on this page.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some links are affiliate links — see our <a href={url('/disclosure')}>Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@reefmetric.com">hello@reefmetric.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
